**Finding: compliant (preferred position).**

The Agreement imposes no exclusivity or sole-supplier obligation on Bluefly. Targeted searches for "exclusive", sole-source, requirements-purchase, minimum-volume and no-other-provider language surfaced only:

- § 5.2 — exclusive *warranties* disclaimer (liability/warranty term, not sourcing);
- § 4.3 — charges "exclusive of" taxes;
- §§ 5.4, 12.1 — *nonexclusive* licence grants (which run in our favour or are ordinary licence scope).

Affirmatively, § 14.16 (Freedom of Action) states: "Each party is free to enter into similar agreements with others," and the services/charges provisions (§§ 4.1, 11.5, 13.1) create no purchase commitment. No redline proposed.
